	)
	(text "DESAT > 10.3-10.9 V (above the 9.8 V maximum trip) -> MMBT3904 -> MMBT3906 charges BG to VEE + 10 V;\nper device AO3400A + 22R pull the gate to VEE; BG holds ~3 us (1k + FET gates)."
